OL,3,GNEWSASinkhole revealed 50m mine shaft
OL,4,Abeneath road
OL,5,
OL,6,FWork is taking place to repair a
OL,7,Fsinkhole which revealed a 50m (164ft)
OL,8,Fmine shaft under a busy road in east
OL,9,FManchester.
OL,11,FPart of the northbound carriageway on
OL,12,FAlan Turing Way has been closed since
OL,13,FMarch, when the road surface began to
OL,14,Fsink.
OL,16,FSince then, Manchester City Council has
OL,17,Ffilled the hole with more than 100
OL,18,Ftonnes of concrete.
OL,20,FIt said it expected the route to be
OL,21,Fopen again December.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
